    "body": "I noticed another error while fixing a wrapping issue. _chosen_ is introduced at the start of this algorithm, so we shouldn't initialize a new _chosen_ in a nested set of steps as that would then not override the outer _chosen_ (or at least create an ambiguity).\r\n\r\n@domenic can you review?\r\n\r\nNew commit message:\r\n\r\n```\r\nFix variables in The rules for choosing a navigable\r\n\r\nThe chosen variable was incorrectly initialized again in a nested set\r\nof steps, making it seem as if the outer chosen variable was not\r\noverwritten. And it was referred to incorrectly as part of #11208.\r\n\r\nFixes #11282.\r\n```",
